{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COD:World at War</strong> meets <strong>Risk of Rain 2</strong> in this action rogue-lite horde shooter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/f9777eee97eb0b9391f487d011a40d41.poster.avif?t=1757290703\" width=700 height=83 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/f9777eee97eb0b9391f487d011a40d41.webm?t=1757290703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/f532de7e49c754dddfdf325caae34ae6.poster.avif?t=1757290703\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/f532de7e49c754dddfdf325caae34ae6.webm?t=1757290703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You awaken disoriented, tattooed and abandoned in a hellish warzone with no memory. The distant gunfire is the least of your worries as deranged cultists  hunt you down, their unintelligible screams pierce the chaos as they charge clumsily toward you.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>'Milo' is a\u00a0unique blend of RNG and skill-based progression </strong>  <br><strong>A passion project over four years in the making\u00a0\u00a0</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/9b72e63bb0dd72991e7eacbf1e8a5670.poster.avif?t=1757290703\" width=325 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/9b72e63bb0dd72991e7eacbf1e8a5670.webm?t=1757290703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/603b7bced170dc49248ff2d0081f09f5.poster.avif?t=1757290703\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/603b7bced170dc49248ff2d0081f09f5.webm?t=1757290703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/1af5c462cf76f42745ba2a9b2867f1d6.poster.avif?t=1757290703\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/1af5c462cf76f42745ba2a9b2867f1d6.webm?t=1757290703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade\u00a0your\u00a0character</strong>\u00a0in unique ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong>,\u00a0<strong>\u00a0explode enemies </strong>(living or dead)\u00a0to improve your chances of survival  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>co-op</strong> online or local split-screen (no internet connection required for single-player)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from several <strong>unique, detailed levels</strong> to master alone or with your party\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete</strong> in the <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong> to fight for the\u00a0 top rank of the &quot;Highest Wave Survived&quot; or the high score in the <strong>Basketball Minigame </strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>an arsenal of unique weapons</strong> (M1 Garand, M1A1 Thompson, Walther, Combat Knife, Trenchgun,\u00a0 Kar98, Lewis Gun, Chauchat, S&amp;M .38 Revolver, and PPSH) </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood, gore/dismemberment, custom procedural animation, and enemy AI was designed from the ground-up to make every play session feel unique and satisfying </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2665020?t=1757290703","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757290703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/0f4bcc20e1b4748e3c6096a71f571ecda41966d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757290703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/0f4bcc20e1b4748e3c6096a71f571ecda41966d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757290703","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Milo contains graphic violence and gore. You use various weapons to attack and there are rats that eat corpses. "},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2691620,"desc